      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Read this dashboard from top to bottom\n\n1. **Scrape Up** tells you whether Prometheus can reach the service metrics endpoint. If this is red, the service may still be running but observability cannot see it.\n2. **Jobs Waiting** and **Worker Queue Backlog** tell you whether the orchestrator/worker path is building pressure.\n3. **Worker Current State** shows which worker is busy and whether queues are stuck.\n4. **Orchestrator Streams** shows Redis Stream lag/pending counts for creation, projection and finalization.\n5. **Platform Error Logs** is where you look after a number turns bad.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
